TITLE:: ProbeDashboard
summary:: Unified multi-panel audio analysis dashboard
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeMeter, Classes/ProbeScope, Classes/ProbeSpectrum, Classes/ProbeLoudness, Classes/ProbeVectorscope

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeDashboard unifies all core Probe instruments into a synchronized command center.
It embeds Level Meter, Oscilloscope, Spectrum Analyzer, Loudness Meter, and Stereo Vectorscope sub-views within a single resizable interface.

All embedded panels subscribe through the internal telemetry broker, guaranteeing zero duplicate audio-thread measurement synths.

list::
## strong::Unified Interface::: Simultaneous real-time level metering, waveform oscilloscope, FFT spectrum analyzer, ITU-R BS.1770 loudness, and stereo vectorscope.
## strong::Global Theme Propagation::: Changing the dashboard theme propagates dynamically to all embedded panels.
## strong::Master Freeze::: One-click or Spacebar freezing across all panels.
## strong::Broker Telemetry::: Real-time counter of active broker sources and subscriber counts.
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates and displays a new ProbeDashboard window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server:: (defaults to code::Server.default::).

ARGUMENT:: numIns
Number of server input channels to meter.

ARGUMENT:: numOuts
Number of server output channels to meter.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset for oscilloscope, spectrum, and vectorscope (default 0).

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::) or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

ARGUMENT:: targetLUFS
Target loudness in LUFS (-23.0 broadcast or -14.0 streaming).

METHOD:: view
Embed the unified dashboard into a custom parent link::Classes/View:: or link::Classes/Window::.

ARGUMENT:: parent
Parent view or window.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
Dimensions and position as link::Classes/Rect::.

ARGUMENT:: server
Target link::Classes/Server::.

ARGUMENT:: numIns
Input channels count.

ARGUMENT:: numOuts
Output channels count.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Visual theme.

ARGUMENT:: targetLUFS
Target loudness in LUFS.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: dashboardView
Returns the underlying PB_DashboardView composite view.

METHOD:: theme
Change active theme dynamically across the entire dashboard and all embedded panels.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor across all panels.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: targetLUFS
Update target loudness standard.

ARGUMENT:: val
Target LUFS value (e.g. -23.0 or -14.0).

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle freeze across all panels.

METHOD:: close
Close window and cleanly release all broker subscriptions.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;
x = { Saw.ar([110, 110.5]) * 0.25 }.play;
d = Probe.dashboard(s, 2, 2, 0, \graphite);
::
